# General Code Style & Formatting
- Use PascalCase for React component file names (e.g., UserCard.tsx, not user-card.tsx).
- Prefer named exports for components.

# Project Information
- This project is a RAG-based ai app where the user can create workspaces where they can upload any number of documents, and query the RAG about it.

# Project Structure & Architecture
- Design UI with a mobile-first approach.
- Use React Router.
- Use TypeScript where possible.
- Unless stated or a server component would make the most sense, use client-side components.

# Styling & UI
- Use Tailwind CSS for styling.
- Use Shadcn UI for components where possible.
- Remember that the way to add shadcn components is using "npx shadcn@latest add <component-name>"
- shadcn-ui is deprecated, use shadcn@latest